    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">smăragdĭnus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">zmăr-</span></b> ; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">smar- with long a,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Psych. 862</span></i>
			), a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμαράγδινος</span>, <i>of</i> or
				<i>belonging to the emerald</i>, <i>smaragdine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">emplastrum (on account of its green color),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					5, 19, 4</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prata, Prud. l. l.: lapis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Esth. 1, 6</span></i>
			.—Postclass. collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">smăragdĭnĕus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viriditas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 1, § 66</span></i>
			: postis, Ven. Carm. 8, 8, 18.</div>
